abstract: "A synthetic benchmark for examining machine-learning performance, decoy-feature ablation, TreeSHAP interpretation, and an illustrative Green Prioritization Index. The reactions and targets are synthetic and are not experimental chemistry evidence. See TRACEABILITY_REPORT.md for the status and limitations of the archived metrics."
